    "### About\n",
    "For the final private score in the competition, this logistic regression only model achieved a ROC AUC of 0.89552, putting it into the top 14%.  \n",
    "The purpose of this notebook is to see how far logistic regression can go in competing against much more complicated and fancy algorithms. Although the algorithm of logistic regression is simple and straightforward, the techniques in feature engineering used allowed for the creation of a strong and robust model.  \n",
    "The model and techniques presented in this notebook are not comprehensive. There is still significant room for improvement in implementing more robust feature selection and feature engineering techniques."
